    <briefdescription>
<para>Inlines functions marked as &quot;always_inline&quot;. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Note that this does not inline call sites marked as always_inline and does not delete the functions even when all users are inlined. The normal inliner should be used to handle call site inlining, this pass&apos;s goal is to be the simplest possible pass to remove always_inline function definitions&apos; uses by inlining them. The <computeroutput>GlobalDCE</computeroutput> pass can be used to remove these functions once all users are gone. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
